        "sections": [
          {
            "section_type": "example_question",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Solve the inequality <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 0 \\leq 3x+6 &lt; 15.]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "Solve the inequality [MATH: 0 \\leq 3x+6 < 15.]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>EXPLANATION</p>",
            "readable_text": "EXPLANATION",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "example_explanation",
            "normalized_html": "<p>We isolate <span class=\"math\">[MATH: x]</span> by applying the addition and multiplication principles, as usual:\n<span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\eqalign{\n0 &amp;\\leq 3x+6 &lt; 15 \\[5pt]\n0 - 6 &amp;\\leq 3x + 6 -6 &lt; 15-6 \\[5pt]\n-6 &amp;\\leq 3x &lt; 9 \\[5pt]\n\\dfrac{-6}{3} &amp;\\leq \\dfrac{3x}{3} &lt; \\dfrac{9}{3} \\[5pt]\n-2 &amp;\\leq x &lt; 3\n}]</span></p><p>Therefore, the solution is <span class=\"math\">[MATH: -2 \\leq x &lt; 3.]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "We isolate [MATH: x] by applying the addition and multiplication principles, as usual:\n[MATH: \\eqalign{\n0 &\\leq 3x+6 < 15 \\[5pt]\n0 - 6 &\\leq 3x + 6 -6 < 15-6 \\[5pt]\n-6 &\\leq 3x < 9 \\[5pt]\n\\dfrac{-6}{3} &\\leq \\dfrac{3x}{3} < \\dfrac{9}{3} \\[5pt]\n-2 &\\leq x < 3\n}]\n\nTherefore, the solution is [MATH: -2 \\leq x < 3.]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          }
        ],
        "images": [],
        "free_entry_blanks": [],
        "select_lists": [],
        "readable_text": "Example Prompt:\nSolve the inequality [MATH: 0 \\leq 3x+6 < 15.]\n\nContent:\nEXPLANATION\n\nExplanation:\nWe isolate [MATH: x] by applying the addition and multiplication principles, as usual:\n[MATH: \\eqalign{\n0 &\\leq 3x+6 < 15 \\[5pt]\n0 - 6 &\\leq 3x + 6 -6 < 15-6 \\[5pt]\n-6 &\\leq 3x < 9 \\[5pt]\n\\dfrac{-6}{3} &\\leq \\dfrac{3x}{3} < \\dfrac{9}{3} \\[5pt]\n-2 &\\leq x < 3\n}]\n\nTherefore, the solution is [MATH: -2 \\leq x < 3.]"
      },
