        "readable_text": "Prompt:\nWhich of the following number lines gives the solution to [MATH: \u2212 5 \u2264 \u2212 2x + 3 \u2264 5?]\n\nChoices:\na. [IMG: /graphics/q-44758-a-1]\nb. [IMG: /graphics/q-44758-a-5]\nc. [IMG: /graphics/q-44758-a-4]\nd. [IMG: /graphics/q-44758-a-2]\ne. [IMG: /graphics/q-44758-a-3]"
